%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2d56cce9b854dbe4eb4d220d3699184f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Plot_C0_S1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Client::PlotConfig
  chapterId: 0
  sceneId: 1
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    text: Welcome to boot camp, rookie. I am Commander Reinhardt. Use "W, A, S, D"and
      the "mouse wheel" to survey the arena.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: Look at the queue at the top. The Assassin order is already available.
    tutorialTargetId: OwnedReadyBar
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Choose him.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: See that glowing 'Eye' symbol? Real time has come to a halt. As long as
      the eye remains open, you are the one who controls the battlefield.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_YourEye
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Move your Assassin into this position. Don't leave yourself exposed.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: -1}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: 
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Good. It moves very smoothly. Now, press "Wait" to end the turn. Those
      who know how to bide their time are the ones who survive the longest.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_WaitButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: I just voluntarily skipped my turn. Only a fool would blindly rush in when
      the enemy is out of reach.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: 
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 2
    text: Weapons don't swing themselves. Right-click a skill to see what you can
      do.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_WSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: Check the Inspect panel. Read the attack range and damage stats carefully.
      Never swing your weapon at thin air.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_InspectPanel
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Close
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_CancelButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: The distance between us is still too great. Charging in now would be suicide.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_WaitButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 5
    text: Keep waiting. Just take your time and wait for the prey to walk into the
      trap. Lesson 1 ends here.
    tutorialTargetId: C0S1_WaitButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
